# Frequency conversion between gigahertz and kilohertz

Verifies direct conversion between gigahertz and kilohertz in both directions. Gigahertz converts to kilohertz with an integer scale, while kilohertz converts to the coarser unit through decimal promotion and four-place rounding.

>>> source
const forward_whole: int = 1ghz
print(forward_whole->to(khz))
const forward_fractional: decimal = 1.5ghz
print(forward_fractional->to(khz))
const backward_whole: int = 1khz
print(backward_whole->to(ghz))
const backward_fractional: decimal = 1.5khz
print(backward_fractional->to(ghz))

<<< stdout
1000000khz
1500000.0khz
0.0000ghz
0.0000ghz

<<< stderr
